  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Echoing Green (EG) COVID-19 - Kadiwaku Family Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Th purpose of this project is to provide funding to John Ntonta to develop a mobile app that can function offline and contains a library of educational business articles and podcasts to help current beneficiaries learn from home. Due to the increase fear of contracting COVID-19, many citizens avoid leaving their homes to ensure their health and safety. Through this application, they can receive education while staying within the comfort of their homes. This mobile application will also help maintain regular communication with beneficiaries, stakeholders and staff. In addition, due to the loss of 80% of revenue during the past 2 months, staff did not receive their salary. Therefore, a portion of the fund will be used to cover staff salary.</narrative>
  </description>
